      "worked": "The mixture contains $\\frac{80}{100}\\times4=\\frac{16}{5}$ L of pure alcohol. Let $x$ L of water be added. The final volume is $(4+x)$ L, and the amount of pure alcohol is unchanged.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{10}(4+x)&=\\frac{16}{5}\\\\3(4+x)&=32\\\\12+3x&=32\\\\3x&=20\\\\x&=\\frac{20}{3}\\end{align*}$$\nAdd $6\\frac23$ L of water.",
